{"id":"638589","name":"小笼包","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/638589/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"},{"name":"开水","amount":"50g"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"80g"}],"sub":[{"name":"肉馅","amount":"250g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"9克"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"20g"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"6g"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"6g"},{"name":"油","amount":"12g"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"10g"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"姜","amount":"一小块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"肥瘦相间的肉切碎。","img":"images/638589/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加葱姜。","img":"images/638589/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪皮冻料理机打碎，打什么程度根据自己喜欢。","img":"images/638589/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加生抽。","img":"images/638589/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蚝油。","img":"images/638589/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盐。","img":"images/638589/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡精。","img":"images/638589/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"十三香。","img":"images/638589/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"油。","img":"images/638589/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"搅拌均匀，放冰箱冷藏1小时。","img":"images/638589/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面粉加盐，加开水搅拌面絮。","img":"images/638589/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加冷水。","img":"images/638589/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"活成团，醒发半小时。","img":"images/638589/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"面，分成10到15克的小剂子。","img":"images/638589/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放上馅料。","img":"images/638589/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"上锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/638589/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好看又好吃，汤鲜味美。","img":"images/638589/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}